# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; the build context is the
# repository root (docker buildx build -f deploy/Dockerfile.updater .). The updater needs only
# server/ and LICENSE; the web app is not part of it.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.omc
.claude
.dev
docs
testdata
web
packages
api
server/bin
server/internal/webassets/dist
config
cache
deploy
**/.env
**/*.log
coverage
